- **Call it like a function.** `input()` returns an `InputSignal<Order>`, so in the class you read it as `this.order()` and in the template as `order()`. There is no `.value` and no plain `this.order` property — writing `this.order` (without the call) is a bug that gives you the signal function itself, not the order.

